WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Last year, we held a special
Spread the Health fundraiser

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.220
to provide free copies of our
Evidence-Based Eating Guide

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.560
to health care practitioners
across the United States.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:12.300
Thanks to your support,

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:16.620
we were able to send out
12,000 copies

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:19.500
to those who counsel
individuals on healthy eating

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.500
so they could distribute them
to their clients and patients.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.580
Now we want to make it out to
even more people with your help.

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:29.280
Please consider helping us
send even more copies

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:32.700
of this important resource to
health care practitioners in 2023.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.940
With increased publishing
and shipping costs,

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:37.200
we’d be even more
grateful for your help

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:40.080
in getting them directly into
the hands of practitioners.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:44.520
Just $20 allows us to
print and ship about 16 copies

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:45.960
of the Evidence-Based Eating Guide

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:48.900
to doctor’s offices,
hospitals, and health clinics.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:51.600
Please consider making
a donation today

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.700
to help us spread the health!

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.333
Thank you for your support.

